# dexMonitor — Statistics & OHLC

### Stats — last 24h
# Returns: { price_stats: [{exchange, snapshot_count, min_price, max_price, avg_price}],
#            offer_counts: [{exchange, offer_count}], hours: int }
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/stats

###

### Stats — custom window
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/stats?hours=48

###

### OHLC Candlestick Data — last 24h
# Returns: { candles: [{time, open, high, low, close}],
#            offers: [{time, price, premium, exchange, direction, payment_method}],
#            interval_min: int }
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/ohlc

###

### OHLC — custom window
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/ohlc?hours=72
